@0    = ~By the gods! What happened here?~
@1    = ~(Explain what happened).~
@2    = ~Looks like your story matches with the confession note on Zashir’s body. What a psychopath!~
@3    = ~Can we just get going? I want to leave immediately.~
@4    = ~How did you know I was here, anyway?~
@5    = ~We got a report of you boarding a ship with Adrik. He’s a notorious criminal, wanted for kidnapping people and running a slave smuggling ring for the Zhentarim. It took some time, but eventually were able to piece together that he took you here, and so we followed. Gods, if only we were sooner! Are you ready to go back to the Gate?~
@6    = ~Yes.~
@7    = ~Not yet.~
@8    = ~Let's get out of here.~
@9    = ~Well, talk to me when you are.~
@10   = ~You ready to go?~
